  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enabling market access for Tajik agricultural products through improved food safety system</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at addressing the issues related to agro-chemical use and veterinary medicines at national level that apply to all agri-food products of animal and plant origin and for domestic production as well as exports and imports with particular focus on dry apricots and honey (STDF/PG/447)</narrative>
